                    <!-- 12 -->
                    <h2 id="security">12. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
                    <p>Everything the app needs stays on your device, so there is nothing stored on our servers.
                        Purchase connections are encrypted by Apple, Google, and Unity. Support emails are deleted once
                        your request has been handled.</p>

                    <!-- 13 -->
                    <h2 id="changes">13. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy as our apps evolve or regulations change. We will update the
                        "Last updated" date above and, if changes are significant, provide prominent notice. We will
                        never begin collecting personal information from children without first updating this policy
                        and obtaining verifiable parental consent where required by law.</p>

                    <!-- 14 -->
                    <h2 id="contact">14. Contact Us</h2>
                    <p>For any question about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, write to us at
                        <a href="mailto:support@kidamame.com">support@kidamame.com</a>.</p>
